<title>UK: Next says maintains spring/summer sales.</title>
<headline>Next says maintains spring/summer sales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Next Plc said on Friday that it had maintained its sales increase announced in March in the first 14 weeks of the spring/summer season.</p>
</text>
